Clang is a C, C++, Objective-C and Objective-C++ front end for LLVM,
with static analysis tools (scan-build) and, optionally, the extra clang
tools such as clangd and clang-tidy.

It is part of the LLVM-cheri toolchain, built standalone against
devel/llvm-cheri and installed into ${PREFIX}/llvm-cheri.
